  "body": "STAY AWHILE | LIVE EVERY DAY\r\n\r\nImagine having your own peaceful garden oasis, with all the charm and convenience of Orewa right on your doorstep. Privacy at home, with space to relax, entertain and enjoy everyday living.\r\n\r\nTucked away at the rear, this freehold brick and tile unit offers two double bedrooms, generous living spaces and an expansive indoor-outdoor flow opening onto a beautiful, fully fenced garden, perfect for morning coffee, entertaining or simply unwinding.\r\n\r\nFreshly painted throughout, with new carpet, oven, hob and spouting, much of the hard work is already done.\r\n\r\n• Private rear freehold section with a charming, fully fenced garden\r\n• Solid brick & tile unit for effortless, easy-care living\r\n• Spacious living, dining and modern kitchen\r\n• Two generous double bedrooms offering comfort and space\r\n• Modern bathroom featuring a large walk-in shower\r\n• Parking galore! Ample off-street parking, 3 covered parks and generous storage\r\n• Business Mixed Use zoning offering flexibility and future potential\r\n• Walk everywhere! Orewa Beach, cafés, shops and everyday amenities just a short stroll away\r\n\r\nSPACE, PRIVACY AND CONVENIENCE, RIGHT IN THE HEART OF OREWA.\r\n\r\nMake this your own and enjoy the best of Orewa living, every day.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: 4:00 PM, WEDNESDAY 25 NOVEMBER 2026 (unless sold prior).\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of these particulars, no warranty is given by the vendor or the agent as to their accuracy. Interested parties should not rely on these particulars as representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise. Although high standards have been used in preparing this document, no legal responsibility can be accepted for any loss or damage resulting from the content or use of this information. Any photographs show only certain parts of the property as they appeared when taken, and some photographs may have been digitally enhanced for marketing purposes. Areas, amounts, measurements, distances, and all other numerical information are approximate only.\r\n\r\nNote: Every care has been taken to verify the accuracy of the details in this advertisement. However, its accuracy cannot be guaranteed. Prospective purchasers are requested to take necessary action to satisfy themselves with any pertinent matters.",
